                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b63f3df0-2f18-4836-89b1-a2a3f4861924",
                                                "sense_id": "4699fbfe-8566-3383-acc5-23a0a2eed725",
                                                "text": "CHUNGKING, Oct. 10—Chinese counterblows against the Japanese offensive in south China have reeled the Nips back from two towns in the approaches to Kweilin, capital city of Kwangsi Province, today’s Chinese High Command communique announced."
